# float_snap_test.scene
# Reproducer for orientation snap on floating balls.
# 8 named balls packed tightly near the water surface (fluid_height=25)
# so they float and collide with each other.
# snap_log (always-on in code) tracks large orientation changes per frame.
physics on
text off
frames 1800
camera main  500 60 650  600 33 600  0 1 0
# ball <name> <x y z r mass moment rest>
ball a  595 60 595  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball b  605 65 595  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball c  595 60 605  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball d  605 65 605  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball e  600 70 600  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball f  600 55 600  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball g  598 75 598  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
ball h  602 55 602  5.0 50.0 10.0 0.7
